#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Both you and the attendee already have your confirmation emails, so the booking itself is unaffected — this is purely a video setup issue. Consider sending the attendee a video link manually, switching your video provider, or reconnecting it from your dashboard's Video settings."
